  "hints": [
    "A subsequence keeps relative left-to-right order without requiring consecutive adjacency.",
    "For prefixes a[:i] and b[:j]: if a[i-1] == b[j-1], dp[j] = prev_diag + 1; else dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[j-1]).",
    "Pseudocode:\n  prev = [0] * (len(b) + 1)\n  for ch_a in a:\n      cur = [0] * (len(b) + 1)\n      for j, ch_b in enumerate(b, 1):\n          cur[j] = prev[j - 1] + 1 if ch_a == ch_b else max(prev[j], cur[j - 1])\n      prev = cur\n  return prev[-1]"
  ],
